<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="nl-be">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Lesplanning afdruk</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.cdnfonts.com/css/itc-avant-garde-gothic-std-book" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root { color-scheme: light; }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 14px;
      background: #fff;
      color: #000;
      font-family: 'ITC Avant Garde Gothic Std Book', Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.35;
    }
    .no-print {
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      display: flex;
      gap: 8px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .no-print button,
    .no-print a {
      border: 0;
      background: #001f75;
      color: #fff;
      padding: 7px 12px;
      cursor: pointer;
      font: inherit;
      border-radius: 4px;
      text-decoration: none;
      display: inline-block;
    }
    .no-print button.secondary,
    .no-print a.secondary {
      background: #2e2e2e;
    }
    .no-print a.tertiary {
      background: #eef3ff;
      color: #001f75;
    }
    .print-header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      border-bottom: 2px solid #000;
      padding-bottom: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    .print-header img { width: 54px; height: 54px; }
    h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: normal;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.4px;
    }
    p.meta { margin: 3px 0 0; font-size: 11px; }
    .print-summary {
      border: 1px solid #000;
      padding: 6px 8px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      font-size: 11px;
    }
    .warning {
      border: 2px solid #9c0000;
      background: #fff5f5;
      color: #7a1f1f;
      padding: 7px 9px;
      margin: 0 0 12px;
      font-size: 11px;
    }
    h2 {
      margin: 14px 0 6px;
      font-size: 13px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-weight: bold;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
      padding-bottom: 3px;
    }
    h2:first-of-type { margin-top: 6px; }
    .print-item {
      border: 1px solid #000;
      padding: 7px 9px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      break-inside: avoid;
      page-break-inside: avoid;
    }
    .print-item-header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: baseline;
      gap: 8px;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }
    .print-item-title {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }
    .print-item-time {
      white-space: nowrap;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }
    .print-item-meta {
      margin: 3px 0 0;
      font-size: 10px;
      color: #222;
    }
    .print-item-description {
      margin: 5px 0 0;
      font-size: 10.5px;
    }
    .print-item-material {
      margin: 5px 0 0;
      font-size: 10px;
    }
    .print-item-material ul {
      margin: 2px 0 0 16px;
      padding: 0;
    }
    .print-item-steps {
      margin: 5px 0 0 17px;
      padding: 0;
      font-size: 10px;
    }
    .print-item-steps li { margin-bottom: 1px; }
    .print-reserve {
      border: 1px dashed #000;
      padding: 6px 8px;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
      break-inside: avoid;
      page-break-inside: avoid;
    }
    .print-reserve h3 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 11.5px;
    }
    .print-reserve p {
      margin: 2px 0 0;
      font-size: 10px;
    }
    .empty {
      border: 1px solid #000;
      padding: 10px;
      font-size: 11px;
    }
    .small { font-size: 10px; color: #333; margin: 0 0 6px; }
    .footer {
      margin-top: 16px;
      border-top: 1px solid #999;
      padding-top: 5px;
      font-size: 9px;
      color: #555;
    }
    @page {
      size: A4;
      margin: 10mm;
    }
    @media print {
      .no-print { display: none !important; }
      body { padding: 0; }
      .print-item, .print-reserve { break-inside: avoid; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="no-print">
    <button type="button" id="print-button">Print / PDF</button>
    <button class="secondary" type="button" id="back-button">Terug</button>
    <a class="tertiary" href="/les-samenstellen/">Open planner</a>
  </div>

  <header class="print-header">
    <img src="/images/logo.svg" alt="VDC logo">
    <div>
      <h1>VUB Diving Center - Vrijdagtraining</h1>
      <p id="print-meta" class="meta"></p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <div id="print-summary" class="print-summary"></div>
  <p id="print-warning" class="warning" hidden></p>

  <h2>Lesplanning 20:00–21:00</h2>
  <div id="print-plan"></div>

  <h2>Reserve-oefeningen</h2>
  <p class="small">Deze oefeningen zijn niet ingepland. Gebruik ze als er tijd over is of als een oefening wegvalt.</p>
  <div id="print-reserves"></div>

  <p class="footer">VUB Diving Center vzw · vrijdagtraining gevorderden · 20:00–21:00</p>

  <script src="/scripts/les-samenstellen-print.js?version=2026111201"></script>
</body>
</html>
